@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = replace-after-login
@refreshToken = replace-after-login
@adminToken = replace-after-admin-login

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member@gincana.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Refresh with rotation
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}",
  "deviceInfo": "VS Code REST Client"
}

### Current session
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Activities and availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/availability?actionDate=2026-09-20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create draft (replace UUIDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
  "activityId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
  "actionDate": "2026-09-20",
  "quantity": 5,
  "unit": "unidade",
  "participantIds": []
}

### Upload evidence
POST {{baseUrl}}/submissions/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/evidences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GincanaBoundary

--GincanaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="evidence.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./evidence.pdf
--GincanaBoundary--

### Dashboard (approved, pending, total and personal progress)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: progress for every team
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: tasks from one team
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/submissions?organizationId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: approve a task
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/submissions/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
